comment_A:
`MQTT_CLIENT_BUFFER_SIZE` and `MQTT_PROGMEM_STAGE_LEN` were removed here but are still referenced later in this file (e.g., `MQTTclient.setBufferSize(MQTT_CLIENT_BUFFER_SIZE)` and `char stage[MQTT_PROGMEM_STAGE_LEN + 1]`). As-is, this will not compile. Either reintroduce these constants (possibly derived from the new max-length constants) or update the call sites to use the new names/values.
```suggestion
constexpr size_t MQTT_CFG_LINE_MAX_LEN = 1200;
constexpr size_t MQTT_CLIENT_BUFFER_SIZE = MQTT_MSG_MAX_LEN;
constexpr size_t MQTT_PROGMEM_STAGE_LEN = MQTT_CFG_LINE_MAX_LEN;
```

