comment_A:
The condition for notNeedCardDom has changed from the original implementation. The original TableRender checked 'props.toolBarRender === false' (explicitly false), but this now checks '!toolBarRender' (any falsy value). This means that if toolBarRender is undefined or null, the behavior will differ from the original. Consider using 'toolBarRender === false' to maintain the original behavior and avoid unintended changes when toolBarRender is undefined.
```suggestion
 const notNeedCardDom =
 search === false && !headerTitle && toolBarRender === false;
```

